The lexicons are embedded in the binary only when the `misaki` feature is on.
The spaCy tokenizer data is embedded only when the `spacy-tokenizer` feature
is on. The tagger weights are not part of this crate: `EnglishTagger::from_dir`
and `KokoroG2pModels` read them at run time from a directory. The converted
weights are published in the Hugging Face repo `fs90/kokoro-g2p` (`tagger/`).

`resample_like_librosa` is an independent windowed-sinc design checked
against librosa's output. It contains no librosa or soxr code.

uroman romanization comes from the `uroman` crate dependency under its own
licence. voxr redistributes none of it.


